                ScriptureVerse("John 5:17–18", "Therefore the Jews sought all the more to kill Him, because He not only broke the Sabbath, but also said that God was His Father, making Himself equal with God.", "Equal with God", "Jesus's claims to work uninterruptedly as the Father works proved equality of nature.")
